### Configuring
```
$ cat << EOF | sudo tee /opt/BIOVIA/MaterialsStudio24.1/etc/Gateway/configurations/default/conf/gwport.conf
Listen 0.0.0.0:18888
EOF
$ /opt/BIOVIA/MaterialsStudio24.1/etc/Gateway/gwstart
$ /opt/BIOVIA/MaterialsStudio24.1/etc/Gateway/gwstop 
```
### Admin (```$ cd /opt/BIOVIA/MaterialsStudio24.1/etc/Gateway```) 
* DSMgr.exe 提示的用户名和密码 You should add a new account to give access to a Windows client.
```sh
$ ./gwusers -list
$ ./gwusers -add a # Edf456@@
$ ./gwusers -update gatekeeper
```
* make gpu available
```sh 
$ ./gwstop
$ sed -i 's/gpuavailable=no/gpuavailable=yes/' config/srv_templates/root/dsd/conf/gw-info.sbd.srv.rw.template
$ rm -rf root_default/dsd/conf/ 
$ ./gwstart
``` 
* Modify memory
```sh
$ sed -i '/installedmemory/d'        root_default/dsd/conf/gw-info.sbd.srv.ro
$ echo "installedmemory=29000 MB" >> root_default/dsd/conf/gw-info.sbd.srv.ro 
$ ./gwrestart
```